  "id": "motor-test",
  "term": "motor test",
  "definition": "A motor test is an assessment of motor performance or motor skills, often used in children to measure general movement-related abilities as part of screening or talent identification. In this context, it is used alongside other measures to estimate a child’s motor potential and developmental readiness for later sport-specific performance.",
